The values is a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5.
The groupsize is 2.
The last is the last position of values.
The start is 0.
Repeat while start plus groupsize minus 1 is at most last.
The left is start.
The right is start plus groupsize minus 1.
Repeat while left is less than right, swap item left of values and item right of values, add 1 to left, subtract 1 from right.
Set start to start plus groupsize.

For each value in values, display value.
